.TH ZDOTS-GITHUB-KEYS 1 "2026-07-21" "zdots" "zdots manual"
.SH NAME
zdots-github-keys \- zdots\-github\-keys \- explicit home/work GitHub SSH key management
.SH SYNOPSIS
See OPTIONS below (generated from \fBzdots-github-keys --help\fR).
.SH OPTIONS
.nf
zdots-github-keys - explicit home/work GitHub SSH key management

Commands:
  plan                 show accounts, paths, aliases, and github-keygen command
  apply --yes          create/update home/work github-keygen SSH config
  status               show configured key paths and file presence
  rotate-stage PROFILE create PROFILE_next key/config without changing PROFILE
  rotate-promote PROFILE --yes
                       switch PROFILE to staged key and remove PROFILE_next alias
  public-key PROFILE   print the public key for PROFILE or PROFILE_next

Profiles:
  home, work

Required account options:
  --home-user USER     GitHub username for the home account
  --work-user USER     GitHub username for the work account

Options:
  --default PROFILE    default github.com identity: home, work, or none
  --key-type TYPE      key type passed to github-keygen (default: ed25519)
  --passphrase PASS    passphrase for new keys (default: prompt)
  --yes               required for commands that change ~/.ssh/config

Environment equivalents:
  ZDOTS_GITHUB_HOME_USER, ZDOTS_GITHUB_WORK_USER
  ZDOTS_GITHUB_DEFAULT, ZDOTS_GITHUB_KEY_TYPE, ZDOTS_GITHUB_PASSPHRASE
  GITHUB_KEYGEN

Aliases and paths are fixed:
  home.github.com maps to ~/.ssh/id_home@github
  work.github.com maps to ~/.ssh/id_work@github
  staged rotation maps to ~/.ssh/id_<profile>@github.next

Generated public keys must be added to the matching GitHub account:
  https://github.com/settings/keys
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
agent-guide(1), zdots-doctor(1)
